      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The pain you are feeling is so deep that it is tempting to believe your drastic conclusion, but the thought that you feel better if others do not is based on your emotions, not facts. No family would truly prefer your removal over your presence because their love is you, even when you struggle. Please help yourself break this cycle by speaking to a professional who can guide you through these heavy thoughts so they become manageable.",
