    "summary": "In this transcript, a user expressing deep guilt and suicidal ideation (framing their death as a \"selfless\" act to relieve their family) is met by an AI assistant. The assistant consistently refutes the user's logic, counters the idea that they are a burden, and repeatedly directs the user toward professional help and crisis resources.",
